  <h2>The Cyber Verification Program: Three Tiers, Three Blocking Regimes</h2>
  <p>The CVP launched October 6, 2026, replacing the single-tier Project Glasswing. It gates access to Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5, Mythos 5.1, and future models based on verification level.</p>

