  <h3>3. Ongoing Operational Costs</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Grant maintenance:</strong> Annual re-verification; grants may be narrowed or withdrawn.</li>
    <li><strong>Data retention:</strong> CVP requires data retention for misuse monitoring. Orgs with ZDR (zero data retention) exemptions for Fable/Mythos can use CVP with ZDR until Enterprise Frontier Safeguards launches.</li>
    <li><strong>Third-party platform access:</strong> Requires platform support for CVP. Platform must provide Anthropic enrollment link. Not all coding tools support this yet.</li>
    <li><strong>Client-facing product restriction:</strong> CVP grants cover internal security work only. Building client-facing products with CVP access requires separate productization application (coming soon to Verification Portal).</li>
  </ul>

